<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "システム音\The_Lampe.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Thank you for your hard work, <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama. You have reached the second ending of the True Jusatsu Arc.<PG>
The holy war woven from the odd thing Erina Goto and Chigaya Niimura have in common came to a close in an unexpected way.<PG>
It seems Chigaya Niimura knows something, but it appears that is not yet to be told.<PG>
In any case, I would like Erina Goto to go on living from now on without being crushed by her own guilt.<PG>
Now then, let us go on to the next scenario. This world still seems vast, and deeply rooted.<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
